          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 425.24,
          "end": 428.421,
          "en": "that is what Vue does under the hood.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 428.421,
          "end": 432.41,
          "en": "It keeps track of all your data properties here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 432.41,
          "end": 435.87,
          "en": "and whenever such a property changes,",
